{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the ultimate excavation experience with <strong>Dig</strong>! This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a thrilling, yet strangely <strong>Cozy &amp; Relaxing</strong> journey beneath the surface. Whether you want to dig a hole to find peace or dig deep to find fortune, the underground world awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your pickaxe and start to dig! Every layer of earth you uncover brings you closer to hidden treasures, from valuable resources to legendary artifacts. In Dig, the deeper you go, the more the world opens up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Rare Blueprints:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you dig, keep an eye out for ancient Blueprints. These are the keys to unlocking advanced technology and secret items buried for centuries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Deep Crafting System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just find items\u2014create them! Use the <strong>Blueprints</strong> you discover to craft specialized gear and enhance your efficiency as you dig hole after hole.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned finds to boost your performance. <strong>Upgrade your shovel, battery, and storage capacity</strong> to ensure the fun never stops and the deeper layers become reachable.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Face unique obstacles and terrains. Whether you dig a hole in rocky caves or sandy depths, the adventure never feels the same twice.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548510?t=1773929118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/70f33e1cdf13d63f765e6fe44bf67c8074b0218b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773929118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/e6f25ac2da038230decb667d9d5ede72a7e7934d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773929118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/e6f25ac2da038230decb667d9d5ede72a7e7934d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773929118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d78c467fb89264f657e7d35b85f126e2.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the ultimate excavation experience with <strong>Dig</strong>! This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a thrilling, yet strangely <strong>Cozy &amp; Relaxing</strong> journey beneath the surface. Whether you want to dig a hole to find peace or dig deep to find fortune, the underground world awaits your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your pickaxe and start to dig! Every layer of earth you uncover brings you closer to hidden treasures, from valuable resources to legendary artifacts. In Dig, the deeper you go, the more the world opens up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Rare Blueprints:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you dig, keep an eye out for ancient Blueprints. These are the keys to unlocking advanced technology and secret items buried for centuries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/c6dc2aea890213403c9b0c017e68840a.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Deep Crafting System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just find items\u2014create them! Use the <strong>Blueprints</strong> you discover to craft specialized gear and enhance your efficiency as you dig hole after hole.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/f17251fa9f8892f5f63dc3a2436733a4.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned finds to boost your performance. <strong>Upgrade your shovel, battery, and storage capacity</strong> to ensure the fun never stops and the deeper layers become reachable.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.poster.avif?t=1773929118\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.webm?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/extras/d45a1a03ff6277f3b349189a8721ea75.mp4?t=1773929118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Challenges:</strong> Face unique obstacles and terrains. Whether you dig a hole in rocky caves or sandy depths, the adventure never feels the same twice.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alkame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548510/b5693138c7576213bc3a13eb94430a2935eab65e/header.jpg?t=1773929118","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548510/1581611240/4b5a85b97d066bef7190af7e929f5dc39ab9f757/1771793527/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771794056","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548510/1581611240/4b5a85b97d066bef7190af7e929f5dc39ab9f757/1771793527/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771794056","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548510/1581611240/4b5a85b97d066b